    "turn_text": "over the past 15 years, we have come so close to passing bipartisan immigration reform that provides a pathway to legal residents for so many, all in some cases. And this is something that Republicans and Democrats have agreed on in the past. And I know that there are still a large amount of Republicans and Democrats who would come together and pass a bipartisan immigration bill that would significantly improve, if not completely solve, this immigration crisis.",
