  {
    "episode_id": 50764,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50764.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 110,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. So how do you see government's role? So the role of policy in conjunction with the role of the activities of people of faith or the activities of regular citizens. So it's all part of a system. But what's the role of government policy in creating a larger culture of sustained healing?",
